===Follow Fu Xuan{{subst:void|<!--102120113-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Alchemy Commission|update|The master diviner soon returns to the encampment. According to her, the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus have summoned bizarre abominations and used sorcery to disturb people's minds, making the Knights unable to push forward.<br />She has figured out the reason but require the help of short-life individuals like you to overcome it.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
