===Turn off the 3 small elixir crucibles{{subst:void|<!--102120124-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Alchemy Commission|update|Deep in the bowels of the Alchemy Commission, the ancient elixir crucibles have been reactivated, and smoke bellows from them. This area was once named Evemist Mansion due to the mist generated by the elixir crucibles. Now these mists have been poisoned by the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus, and can quickly induce mara in long-life species.<br />However, as short-life individuals led here by the Stellaron Hunters, you happen to be the indispensable help that Fu Xuan desperately needs.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''March 7th:''' *sigh* I feel like... even though long-life species get to live forever...
:'''March 7th:''' ...they aren't so different from us short-life species when it comes to worries and suffering.

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''March 7th:''' Wait, Miss Tingyun, why are you still here!? You're too close to the crucible!
:'''Tingyun:''' Thank you for the concern, but I'm fine~ The general commanded me to stay with you &mdash; I dare not go against military orders.
:'''Welt:''' Your life is more important, Miss Tingyun. Go back, we can explain to the general.
:'''Tingyun:''' Hehe, there's really no need &mdash; I've spent my years traveling the universe! Not to mention, I'm younger and stronger than I look.
:'''Tingyun:''' Even you benefactors have probably lived longer than me.
:The crucible starts to shake, and smoke emits out of the cold elixir crucible.
:'''March 7th:''' T&mdash;Turn it off! (Trailblazer), why did you turn it on!?
:The crucible gradually stops shaking, and the smoke slowly ceases to pour out.
:'''March 7th:''' Seems like the smoke is getting thinner...
:'''Welt:''' Not thin enough. We need to hurry.
{{Dialogue End}}

